# HAT TRICK: a gentle start, a hard wall at the end. "cheat fair L N W" plays
# screen L N times with a modest demo player (W = 6 plans a decision, where
# the full one weighs 64 and tries every running jump) and no spare life,
# and counts the tries that keep their life until the screen is cleared or
# the clock runs out; it also times how long a kid who just stands at the
# start lasts (600 = ten seconds, untouched). The first three screens let
# almost every try through and leave a kid standing still alone for four
# seconds or more; the Big Stadium's hardest screens catch a modest player
# out far more often.
game hattrick
wait 5
cheat level 1
cheat fair 1 24 6
expect fair_pct >= 90
expect fair_idle >= 240
cheat fair 2 24 6
expect fair_pct >= 90
expect fair_idle >= 240
cheat fair 3 24 6
expect fair_pct >= 90
expect fair_idle >= 240
cheat fair 34 24 6
expect fair_pct <= 75
cheat fair 35 24 6
expect fair_pct <= 75
cheat fair 39 24 6
expect fair_pct <= 75
